    {
      "id": "p0074-b005",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "source": {
        "text": "Undertale's title has two official English spellings, according to Toby: \"Undertale\" and \"UNDERTALE\". But what about in Japanese? Surprisingly, the answer is basically the same: just \"UNDERTALE\".",
        "raw": "Underta/e's title has two official English spellings, according to Toby:\n\"Undertale\" and \"UNDERTALE\". But what about in Japanese? Surprisingly, the\nanswer is basically the same: just \"UNDERTALE\".",
        "status": "corrected",
        "languages": [
          "en"
        ],
        "bbox": [
          0.28937956,
          0.39274286,
          0.89721645,
          0.44165714
        ],
        "mask_bbox": [
          0.28735323,
          0.39202857,
          0.89924278,
          0.44272857
        ],
        "line_ids": [
          10,
          11,
          12
        ]
      },
      "translation": {
        "text": "Toby 说，游戏标题有两种官方英语写法：“Undertale”和“UNDERTALE”。日语呢？出人意料，基本还是一样，就是“UNDERTALE”。",
        "status": "draft",
        "spans": [
          {
            "start": 22,
            "end": 31,
            "italic": true,
            "lang": "en"
          }
        ]
      },
