    {
      "id": "p0074-b006",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "source": {
        "text": "At first, it might seem odd for a Japanese game translation to leave an English title untranslated - after all, shouldn't a translation actually, you know, translate things? If anything should get translated, it should at least be the title, right?",
        "raw": "At first, it might seem odd for a Japanese game translation to leave an English\ntitle untranslated - after all, shouldn't a translation actually, you know, translate\nthings? If anything should get translated, it should at least be the title, right?",
        "status": "corrected",
        "languages": [
          "en"
        ],
        "bbox": [
          0.29442511,
          0.45803571,
          0.89578789,
          0.50629286
        ],
        "mask_bbox": [
          0.28735323,
          0.45732143,
          0.89924278,
          0.50736429
        ],
        "line_ids": [
          13,
          14,
          15
        ]
      },
      "translation": {
        "text": "日语译版竟然保留英语标题，乍看也许有点怪。毕竟，所谓翻译，不就是要……翻译吗？其他地方不说，至少标题该译一下吧？",
        "status": "draft",
        "spans": []
      },
      "annotations": [],
      "layout": {
        "bbox": [
          0.295494,
          0.45660714,
          0.89721645,
          0.50986429
        ],
        "font_size": 20,
        "line_height": 1.45,
        "font_weight": 450,
        "background": "transparent",
        "text_align": "justify",
        "auto_height": true,
        "limit_bottom": 0.7164285714285714,
        "snap_to_guides": true,
