    {
      "id": "p0074-b007",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "source": {
        "text": "The choice to leave Undertale's name in English was intentional - it's quite common for English words to remain unchanged in English-to-Japanese video game translations. There are two main reasons for this: English already plays a major role in Japanese culture, and English has been a part of Japanese video games since video games were invented. In other words, Japanese gamers are accustomed to a certain amount of English in games.",
        "raw": "The choice to leave Underta/e's name in English was intentional - it's quite\ncommon for English words to remain unchanged in English-to-Japanese video\ngame translations. There are two main reasons for this: English already plays a\nmajor role in Japanese culture, and English has been a part of Japanese video\ngames since video games were invented. In other words, Japanese gamers are\naccustomed to a certain amount of English in games.",
        "status": "corrected",
        "languages": [
          "en"
        ],
        "bbox": [
          0.29620828,
          0.52031429,
          0.89433907,
          0.62380714
        ],
        "mask_bbox": [
          0.28735323,
          0.5196,
          0.89924278,
          0.62487857
        ],
        "line_ids": [
          16,
          17,
          18,
          19,
          20,
          21
        ]
      },
      "translation": {
        "text": "保留英语名称是有意为之。英语游戏译成日语时，留下英语词很常见，主要有两个原因：英语早已在日本文化中占据重要位置，而且电子游戏诞生以来，日本游戏里就一直有英语。换句话说，日本玩家早已习惯游戏中出现一定量的英语。",
        "status": "draft",
        "spans": []
      },
      "annotations": [],
      "layout": {
        "bbox": [
          0.295494,
          0.51888571,
          0.89721645,
          0.62737857
        ],
        "font_size": 20,
        "line_height": 1.45,
        "font_weight": 450,
        "background": "transparent",
        "text_align": "justify",
        "auto_height": true,
        "limit_bottom": 0.7164285714285714,
        "snap_to_guides": true,
        "resize_anchor": "left",
        "gap_before": 12,
        "flow_after": "p0074-b006"
